162
00:12:18.905 --> 00:12:21.115
I don't want to talk to you
for the rest of this whole thing.

163
00:12:21.199 --> 00:12:24.744
-Oh, come on. It's just a practical joke.
-It's not a funny joke.

164
00:12:27.330 --> 00:12:29.332
-Manny!
-What?

165
00:12:30.250 --> 00:12:31.918
Get your cousin out of
that damn clown suit.

166
00:12:31.960 --> 00:12:33.086
He's having a heat stroke again.

167
00:12:33.169 --> 00:12:34.295
Scaring white folks.

168
00:12:34.379 --> 00:12:36.256
I'm hot! Makeup's melting.
It hurts my eyes.

169
00:12:37.048 --> 00:12:39.717
Here? No, no, no, what is this?
You said... You said half a car,

170
00:12:39.759 --> 00:12:41.386
not half a piece of crap, Dad.

171
00:12:41.469 --> 00:12:43.846
When I was your age, I'd have been
happy with four wheels and an engine.

172
00:12:43.930 --> 00:12:45.431
Okay, let me explain
something to you. Okay?

173
00:12:45.473 --> 00:12:46.849
-You ever see 40-Year-Old Virgin?
-Yeah.

174
00:12:46.933 --> 00:12:50.061
Okay, that's what this is.
And this is 50-year-old virgin.

175
00:12:50.103 --> 00:12:51.938
-Okay.
-You want me to live that life?

176
00:12:51.980 --> 00:12:54.232
-No sacrifice, no victory.
-Yeah, no victory. You know, I got it.

177
00:12:54.274 --> 00:12:55.608
