181
00:13:02.907 --> 00:13:05.702
Well, my son here,
looking to buy his first car.

182
00:13:06.577 --> 00:13:08.705
-You come to see me?
- I had to.

183
00:13:08.788 --> 00:13:13.167
That practically makes us family.
Uncle Bobby B, baby. Uncle Bobby B.

184
00:13:13.251 --> 00:13:15.628
-Sam.
-Sam, let me talk to you.

185
00:13:16.045 --> 00:13:20.633
