-Yeah.

196
00:13:56.836 --> 00:13:58.171
It got racing...

197
00:13:58.796 --> 00:14:00.673
Yeah, what's this?
What the heck is this?

198
00:14:00.757 --> 00:14:02.550
I don't know nothing about this car.

199
00:14:02.633 --> 00:14:03.885
-Manny!
-What?

200
00:14:03.968 --> 00:14:06.596
What is this? This car! Check it out!

201
00:14:06.679 --> 00:14:09.182
I don't know, boss! I've never seen it!
That's loco!

202
00:14:09.265 --> 00:14:11.809
Don't go Ricky Ricardo on me, Manny!
Find out!

203
00:14:11.851 --> 00:14:13.436
Feels good.

204
00:14:16.356 --> 00:14:18.024
