-Yeah, but it's custom.

208
00:14:29.118 --> 00:14:30.203
It's custom faded?

209
00:14:30.244 --> 00:14:33.039
Well, this is your first car.
I wouldn't expect you to understand.

210
00:14:33.122 --> 00:14:35.958
-Five grand.
-No, I'm not paying over four. Sorry.

211
00:14:36.334 --> 00:14:37.960
Kid, come on, get out. Get out the car.

212
00:14:38.044 --> 00:14:39.629
No, no, no.
You said cars pick their drivers.

213
00:14:39.712 --> 00:14:42.924
Well, sometimes they pick a driver
