225
00:15:10.701 --> 00:15:13.830
That one's my favourite,
drove all the way from Alabammy.

226
00:15:31.055 --> 00:15:32.056
$4,000.

227
00:15:44.694 --> 00:15:45.862
Steve.

228
00:15:45.945 --> 00:15:47.864
