your little Taco Bell dog and this
whole operation you got going on here.

1175
01:18:41.717 --> 01:18:44.011
-What operation?
-That is what we are gonna find out.

1176
01:18:44.053 --> 01:18:46.680
I think direct contact.

1177
01:18:52.061 --> 01:18:53.687
-Son?
-Yeah.

1178
01:18:54.730 --> 01:18:57.650
-Step forward, please.
-Just stand?

1179
01:19:03.405 --> 01:19:04.907
Fourteen rads.

1180
01:19:06.450 --> 01:19:07.952
Bingo! Tag them and bag them!

1181
01:19:08.661 --> 01:19:10.579
If you hurt my dog, I'll kick your ass!

1182
01:19:10.663 --> 01:19:12.414
Get me a sample on
that vegetation ASAP!

1183
01:19:12.456 --> 01:19:14.041
Sam! Do not say anything, Sam!

1184
01:19:14.083 --> 01:19:16.001
-Yeah.
-Not a word until we get a lawyer!

1185
01:19:20.256 --> 01:19:21.423
So,

1186
01:19:22.841 --> 01:19:26.345
LadiesMan217.

1187
01:19:26.428 --> 01:19:29.890
That is your eBay username, right?

1188
01:19:29.932 --> 01:19:32.309
Yeah, but, you know,
it was a typo and I ran with it.

1189
01:19:32.393 --> 01:19:33.394
What do you make of this?

1190
01:19:33.435 --> 01:19:36.063
My name is Sam Witwicky, okay?
And my...

1191
01:19:36.105 --> 01:19:37.273
Is that you?

1192
01:19:37.356 --> 01:19:39.608
Yeah, that sounds like LadiesMan.

1193
01:19:39.650 --> 01:19:44.530
Last night at the station, you told
the officer your car transformed.

1194
01:19:45.823 --> 01:19:48.200
-Enlighten me.
-Well, here's what I said, okay?

1195
01:19:48.284 --> 01:19:52.788
"Cause this is a total misunderstanding
that my car had been stolen...

1196
01:19:52.830 --> 01:19:54.999
-Really?
-...from me, from my home,

1197
01:19:55.082 --> 01:19:58.085
but it's fine now because it's back!
It came back!

1198
01:19:58.127 --> 01:19:59.920
-Well, not by itself.
-Well, no.

1199
01:19:59.962 --> 01:20:03.465
Because cars don't do that
because that would be crazy.

1200
01:20:06.552 --> 01:20:08.178
That's funny. That is so funny.

1201
01:20:08.262 --> 01:20:10.806
So what do you kids know
about aliens, huh?

1202
01:20:11.932 --> 01:20:14.727
Oh, you mean, like a Martian?
Like what, E.T.? No.

1203
01:20:14.810 --> 01:20:16.312
-It's an urban legend.
-Yeah.

1204
01:20:16.395 --> 01:20:17.563
You see this?

1205
01:20:17.646 --> 01:20:20.274
This is an I-can-do-whatever-l-want
and-get-away-with-it badge.

1206
01:20:20.316 --> 01:20:23.152
-Right.
-I'm gonna lock you up forever.

1207
01:20:23.193 --> 01:20:24.486
Oh, God. You know what?
Don't listen to him.

1208
01:20:24.528 --> 01:20:26.989
He's just pissy 'cause he's got to
get back to guarding the mall.

1209
01:20:27.031 --> 01:20:30.159
You, in the training bra, do not test me.

1210
01:20:30.200 --> 01:20:32.328
Especially with your daddy's parole
coming up.

1211
01:20:32.411 --> 01:20:33.829
What? Parole?

1212
01:20:33.912 --> 01:20:37.291
-It's nothing.
-Oh, grand theft auto, that ain't nothing?

1213
01:20:37.333 --> 01:20:39.376
You know those cars my dad
used to teach me to fix?

1214
01:20:39.460 --> 01:20:41.211
Well, they... They weren't always his.

1215
01:20:41.295 --> 01:20:42.421
You stole cars?

1216
01:20:42.504 --> 01:20:44.214
Well, we couldn't always afford
a babysitter,

1217
01:20:44.298 --> 01:20:46.133
so sometimes he had to take me along.

1218
01:20:46.175 --> 01:20:48.510
She's got her own juvie record
to prove it!

1219
01:20:48.594 --> 01:20:51.263
She's a criminal. Criminals are hot.

1220
01:20:52.348 --> 01:20:57.019
That'd be a real shame if he had to rot
in jail the rest of his natural life.

1221
01:20:57.102 --> 01:20:59.438
It is time to talk!

1222
01:21:06.153 --> 01:21:07.613
Big! It's big!

1223
01:21:12.326 --> 01:21:14.328
Go, go, go, go!

1224
01:21:14.703 --> 01:21:17.373
-I can't see it! I can't see it!
-Shift your weight towards the front!

1225
01:21:17.456 --> 01:21:18.916
All right! All right!

1226
01:21:33.472 --> 01:21:35.808
You A-holes are in trouble now.

1227
01:21:35.891 --> 01:21:42.439
Gentlemen, I want to introduce you
to my friend, Optimus Prime.

1228
01:21:44.650 --> 01:21:48.445
Taking the children was a bad move.

1229
01:21:48.529 --> 01:21:51.949
Autobots, relieve them of their weapons.

1230
01:21:55.536 --> 01:21:57.287
Freeze!

1231
01:21:57.913 --> 01:21:59.331
-Whoa! Whoa!
-Give me those!

1232
01:21:59.415 --> 01:22:00.499
Whoa!

1233
01:22:01.917 --> 01:22:03.001
Whoa!

1234
01:22:13.762 --> 01:22:15.097
Hi, there.

1235
01:22:15.389 --> 01:22:20.144
You don't seem afraid.
Are you not surprised to see us?

1236
01:22:20.811 --> 01:22:25.774
Look, there are
S-Seven protocols, okay?

1237
01:22:26.358 --> 01:22:27.693
I'm not authorised
to communicate with you

1238
01:22:27.776 --> 01:22:30.028
except to tell you
I can't communicate with you.

1239
01:22:30.112 --> 01:22:32.739
-Get out of the car.
-All right.

1240
01:22:33.323 --> 01:22:34.491
-Me? You want me to get...
-Now!

1241
01:22:34.575 --> 01:22:36.118
All right, all right. Get out. Hey.

1242
01:22:36.160 --> 01:22:39.580
All right, I'm... I'm getting out.
I'm getting out. You see?

1243
01:22:39.621 --> 01:22:43.167
Very nifty how you put us down
without really killing us.

1244
01:22:43.250 --> 01:22:44.793
You're good with handcuffs, too,
now, huh?

1245
01:22:44.877 --> 01:22:45.919
How you doing?

1246
01:22:45.961 --> 01:22:47.754
-You weren't supposed to hear all that.
-How's it going, huh?

1247
01:22:47.796 --> 01:22:50.007
-Yeah.
-This is real.

1248
01:22:50.090 --> 01:22:53.302
Now, listen. If I choose to engage
with him, mum is the word, all right?

1249
01:22:53.343 --> 01:22:57.139
Sam, I have a record
because I wouldn't turn my dad in.

1250
01:22:57.723 --> 01:23:01.935
When have you had to sacrifice
anything in your perfect little life?

1251
01:23:03.479 --> 01:23:05.147
Big guys. Big guys with big guns, huh?

1252
01:23:05.230 --> 01:23:08.150
What is Sector Seven? Answer me.

1253
01:23:08.192 --> 01:23:10.736
I'm the one who asks questions
around here. Not you, young man!

1254
01:23:10.819 --> 01:23:13.071
-How'd you know about the aliens?
-Where did you take my parents?

1255
01:23:13.155 --> 01:23:15.157
-I am not at liberty to discuss it.
-No?

1256
01:23:15.240 --> 01:23:17.159
Hey. You touch me,
that's a federal offence.

1257
01:23:17.201 --> 01:23:18.994
Do-whatever-you-want
and-get-away-with-it badge, right?

1258
01:23:19.036 --> 01:23:21.914
Yeah. Brave now all of a sudden, with
his big alien friend standing over there.

1259
01:23:21.997 --> 01:23:25.209
-Where is Sector Seven?
-Wouldn't you like to know?

1260
01:23:30.464 --> 01:23:31.465
Hey!

1261
01:23:31.507 --> 01:23:34.510
Bumblebee, stop lubricating the man.

1262
01:23:34.551 --> 01:23:36.512
Get that thing to stop, huh?

1263
01:23:37.971 --> 01:23:41.308
-All right, tough guy, take it off.
-What are you talking about?

1264
01:23:41.350 --> 01:23:44.102
-Your clothes, all of it, off.
-For what?

1265
01:23:45.312 --> 01:23:47.189
For threatening my dad.

1266
01:23:50.192 --> 01:23:56.156
Little lady, this is the beginning
of the end of your life.

1267
01:23:57.866 --> 01:23:59.576
You're a criminal.

1268
01:24:00.202 --> 01:24:03.038
Let's face facts. It's in your gene pool.

1269
01:24:04.498 --> 01:24:07.376
Those are nice.
Now get behind the pole.

1270
01:24:07.417 --> 01:24:08.460
All right.

1271
01:24:08.544 --> 01:24:10.671
This is such a felony, what you're doing.

1272
01:24:12.673 --> 01:24:14.591
-I will hunt you down, okay?
-He'll hunt you down.

1273
01:24:14.716 --> 01:24:16.885
-Without any remorse!
-No remorse.

1274
01:24:16.969 --> 01:24:18.262
-Enjoy.
-Okay?

1275
01:24:18.345 --> 01:24:22.808
-We have got to alert everyone.
-They already know. Speaker.

1276
01:24:29.314 --> 01:24:31.275
Optimus! Incoming!

1277
01:24:38.949 --> 01:24:40.242
Roll out.

1278
01:24:47.082 --> 01:24:50.460
Okay, I'm picking up rad readings
under that bridge right down there.

1279
01:24:53.297 --> 01:24:56.758
Okay, I'm getting really good rad
readings. Forty-two and higher.

1280
01:24:56.800 --> 01:24:58.176
Up you get.

1281
01:25:02.848 --> 01:25:04.850
Okay, we're dropping in.

1282
01:25:08.854 --> 01:25:11.481
Really strong readings right down
below us. There he is.

1283
01:25:11.565 --> 01:25:13.775
Ship one and two, come on in.

1284
01:25:14.776 --> 01:25:17.446
That's it, right there.
Mark him, mark him.

1285
01:25:17.529 --> 01:25:20.824
Okay, there he is. 11:30. 11:30.
Right off the nose.

1286
01:25:21.325 --> 01:25:22.951
I got it. 12:00.

1287
01:25:26.955 --> 01:25:28.457
Okay, I'm tracking him. I've got him.

1288
01:25:31.376 --> 01:25:33.629
Got him going down the street.

1289
01:25:37.174 --> 01:25:41.803
Okay. Where'd he go, guys? I lost him.
Got no IR signature. Where'd he go?

1290
01:25:42.095 --> 01:25:44.306
Okay, I lost him. I lost him.

1291
01:25:44.806 --> 01:25:46.850
Okay, we're coming around.

1292
01:26:09.498 --> 01:26:11.083
Easy, you two.

1293
01:26:20.425 --> 01:26:23.679
No! No! No, Sam! Sam, don't drop me!

1294
01:26:24.346 --> 01:26:27.349
Sam, don't! Sam, don't! I'm slipping!
I'm slipping!

1295
01:26:28.558 --> 01:26:30.686
-Hold on!
-No!

1296
01:26:34.356 --> 01:26:35.607
Sam!

1297
01:26:41.196 --> 01:26:44.366
All right, we've got him pinned.
We've got him pinned in the river.

1298
01:26:44.408 --> 01:26:45.701
I'm in for the shot.

1299
01:26:45.784 --> 01:26:47.244
Stop! Stop!

1300
01:26:48.412 --> 01:26:50.247
Wait! No!

1301
01:26:53.583 --> 01:26:56.211
-Take the shot, get him.
-Take the shot.

1302
01:26:56.753 --> 01:26:58.004
No!

1303
01:27:14.062 --> 01:27:16.189
No! Stop!

1304
01:27:16.732 --> 01:27:18.066
Stop!

1305
01:27:18.650 --> 01:27:22.112
Get down on the ground! Get down!
Get down!

1306
01:27:23.071 --> 01:27:24.448
What? Okay.

1307
01:27:26.283 --> 01:27:28.493
Look, he's not fighting back!

1308
01:27:29.077 --> 01:27:31.288
Freeze it! Freeze it! Freeze it!

1309
01:27:37.627 --> 01:27:39.254
Stop hurting him!

1310
01:27:48.597 --> 01:27:50.348
Don't let him move!

1311
01:27:51.057 --> 01:27:52.642
I got him here!

1312
01:28:15.791 --> 01:28:16.917
No!

1313
01:28:20.879 --> 01:28:22.714
Happy to see me again?

1314
01:28:24.174 --> 01:28:26.968
Put him in a car
with his little criminal friend.

1315
01:28:32.808 --> 01:28:35.894
I want that thing frozen
and ready for transport!

1316
01:28:44.027 --> 01:28:46.321
Hang back. Let me check it out.

1317
01:28:49.157 --> 01:28:50.575
Optimus,

1318
01:28:52.869 --> 01:28:55.372
are we just gonna stand here
and do nothing?

1319
01:28:55.455 --> 01:28:59.167
There's no way to free Bumblebee
without harming the humans.

1320
01:28:59.251 --> 01:29:02.087
-But it's not right. He...
-Let them leave.

1321
01:29:14.057 --> 01:29:16.476
The Chinese and the Russians
are nearing our area of operations

1322
01:29:16.518 --> 01:29:17.686
in the western Pacific.

1323
01:29:17.769 --> 01:29:20.021
We feel like this could get
out of hand real fast.

1324
01:29:20.063 --> 01:29:22.858
But the next couple of hours
may just define his presidency.

1325
01:29:27.195 --> 01:29:30.073
US and Chinese task forces
approaching 100 nautical miles

1326
01:29:30.156 --> 01:29:31.533
of cruise missile range.

1327
01:29:31.575 --> 01:29:35.161
Tell the strike group commander that
he's not to engage unless fired on first.

1328
01:29:35.203 --> 01:29:37.205
-Yes, sir!
-Mr Secretary?

1329
01:29:39.583 --> 01:29:44.713
Tom Banachek. I'm with Sector Seven,
Advanced Research Division.

1330
01:29:44.754 --> 01:29:48.008
Never heard of it. I'm a little busy, Tom.
I think you can see that.

1331
01:29:51.094 --> 01:29:53.638
-What's going on here?
- I don't know.

1332
01:29:57.225 --> 01:29:59.936
Sit rep! Talk to me!

1333
01:30:00.020 --> 01:30:02.439
-The whole room's gone down, sir.
-I can see that!

1334
01:30:02.522 --> 01:30:04.232
The virus was coded to shut us down.

1335
01:30:04.274 --> 01:30:06.735
-General?
-I'll take a seat.

1336
01:30:07.736 --> 01:30:08.737
What do you mean, "shut us down"?

1337
01:30:08.820 --> 01:30:11.865
They used our network to spread out
to the whole world.

1338
01:30:11.907 --> 01:30:13.074
The blackout's global.

1339
01:30:13.116 --> 01:30:15.994
We have no communications,
satellite and land lines are dead.

1340
01:30:16.077 --> 01:30:20.624
You mean to tell me that I cannot pick
up this telephone and call my family?

1341
01:30:26.546 --> 01:30:30.884
Mr Secretary? I'm here under
direct order from the President.

1342
01:30:32.844 --> 01:30:35.263
You really need to see
what I have in the case.

1343
01:30:38.266 --> 01:30:39.893
You'll have to accept that
there are certain things

1344
01:30:39.935 --> 01:30:42.103
you won't understand right away.

1345
01:30:42.145 --> 01:30:45.523
Sector Seven is a special-access
division of the government

1346
01:30:45.607 --> 01:30:49.027
convened in secret under
President Hoover 80 years ago.

1347
01:30:49.861 --> 01:30:53.990
You may remember NASA JPL
lost the Beagle 2 Mars Rover.

1348
01:30:55.075 --> 01:30:59.371
We told them to report the mission
a complete failure. It wasn't.

1349
01:30:59.788 --> 01:31:02.248
Beagle 2 transmitted 13 seconds.

1350
01:31:02.791 --> 01:31:05.377
This was classified above top secret.

1351
01:31:20.308 --> 01:31:22.978
EDA ended at 170 hours, 48 minutes.

1352
01:31:23.019 --> 01:31:25.689
More than just a pile of Martian rocks.

1353
01:31:26.940 --> 01:31:29.067
This is the image from Mars.

1354
01:31:29.859 --> 01:31:32.654
Here's the image your
Special Ops team was able to retrieve

1355
01:31:32.737 --> 01:31:34.531
from the base attack.

1356
01:31:35.281 --> 01:31:38.410
We believe they are of
the same exoskeletal type,

1357
01:31:39.244 --> 01:31:42.038
and obviously not Russian
or North Korean.

1358
01:31:42.414 --> 01:31:45.125
Are we talking about an invasion?

1359
01:31:45.166 --> 01:31:48.336
We intercepted the message
from your Special Ops team.

1360
01:31:48.378 --> 01:31:51.756
These things can be hurt by
our weapons and now they know it.

1361
01:31:51.840 --> 01:31:53.591
That's why the virus shut us down,

1362
01:31:53.675 --> 01:31:57.012
SO we can't coordinate against
their next attack,

1363
01:31:57.053 --> 01:32:01.599
which I would bet my ridiculous
government salary is coming soon.

1364
01:32:05.437 --> 01:32:07.814
Get word to our fleet commanders
over the National Guard frequency.

1365
01:32:07.856 --> 01:32:11.317
It's a shortwave radio channel.
It might be still working.

1366
01:32:11.359 --> 01:32:14.738
Tell them to turn their ships around
and come home. ASAP!

1367
01:32:14.821 --> 01:32:17.824
And inform all commands to prepare
for imminent attack.

1368
01:32:28.001 --> 01:32:31.296
Captain Lennox, we need you and
your team to come with us right now!

1369
01:32:31.379 --> 01:32:32.380
Let's go!

1370
01:32:37.385 --> 01:32:38.887
She's in here.

1371
01:32:39.220 --> 01:32:40.930
What's going on?

1372
01:32:41.431 --> 01:32:43.308
You're coming with me.

1373
01:32:43.725 --> 01:32:46.436
-You're going to be my advisor.
-Me, too?

1374
01:32:47.395 --> 01:32:48.772
Who's this?

1375
01:32:49.522 --> 01:32:52.650
-He's my advisor.
-He comes, too.

1376
01:33:03.912 --> 01:33:06.414
-So...
-What'd they get you for?

1377
01:33:07.457 --> 01:33:11.753
I bought a car.
Turned out to be an alien robot.

1378
01:33:11.836 --> 01:33:12.837
Wow.

1379
01:33:13.463 --> 01:33:14.631
Who knew?

1380
01:33:31.397 --> 01:33:33.316
Make a hole! Watch your back!

1381
01:33:44.119 --> 01:33:46.871
Please, let this work.

1382
01:33:48.248 --> 01:33:50.166
Fire it up, Optimus.

1383
01:33:51.126 --> 01:33:52.627
The code.

1384
01:33:52.710 --> 01:33:58.133
The code on these glasses indicates
the All Spark is 230 miles from here.

1385
01:33:59.926 --> 01:34:03.763
I sense the Decepticons
are getting ready to mobilise.

1386
01:34:04.889 --> 01:34:06.683
They must know it's here, as well.

1387
01:34:06.766 --> 01:34:08.143
What about Bumblebee?

1388
01:34:08.184 --> 01:34:12.313
We can't just leave him to die
and become some human experiment!

1389
01:34:12.355 --> 01:34:16.401
He'll die in vain
if we don't accomplish our mission.

1390
01:34:16.484 --> 01:34:20.738
Bumblebee is a brave soldier.
This is what he would want.

1391
01:34:20.822 --> 01:34:23.783
Why are we fighting to save
the humans?

1392
01:34:25.160 --> 01:34:28.538
They're a primitive and violent race.

1393
01:34:30.832 --> 01:34:32.876
Were we so different?

1394
01:34:33.751 --> 01:34:38.173
They're a young species.
They have much to learn.

1395
01:34:38.214 --> 01:34:41.050
But I've seen goodness in them.

1396
01:34:41.134 --> 01:34:45.346
Freedom is the right of
all sentient beings.

1397
01:34:45.388 --> 01:34:49.684
You all know there's only one way
to end this war.

1398
01:34:49.726 --> 01:34:52.478
We must destroy the Cube.

1399
01:34:53.229 --> 01:34:57.859
If all else fails, I will unite it
with the spark in my chest.

1400
01:34:57.901 --> 01:34:59.277
That's suicide.

1401
01:34:59.360 --> 01:35:03.198
The Cube is raw power.
It could destroy you both.

1402
01:35:03.239 --> 01:35:07.744
A necessary sacrifice to bring peace
to this planet.

1403
01:35:07.827 --> 01:35:11.164
We cannot let the humans pay
for our mistakes.

1404
01:35:12.582 --> 01:35:15.335
It's been an honour serving with you all.

1405
01:35:15.376 --> 01:35:19.214
-Autobots, roll out!
-We rolling!

1406
01:35:31.226 --> 01:35:34.437
Team attention! Present arms!

1407
01:35:35.063 --> 01:35:39.359
At ease. Captain, Sergeant.
Got your intel. Excellent work.

1408
01:35:39.400 --> 01:35:41.152
Thank you, sir.
What about the gunships?

1409
01:35:41.236 --> 01:35:43.404
They're being retrofitted
with sabot rounds now.

1410
01:35:43.446 --> 01:35:44.739
If they hit us again,
we'll be ready for them.

1411
01:35:44.822 --> 01:35:47.951
But it won't do us much good if we can't
get world communications back up.

1412
01:35:49.410 --> 01:35:50.703
Hey, kid.

1413
01:35:51.746 --> 01:35:54.415
I think we got off to a bad start, huh?

1414
01:35:54.916 --> 01:35:56.084
You must be hungry?

1415
01:35:56.125 --> 01:35:58.169
You want a latte? HoHo?
Double venti macchiato?

1416
01:35:58.253 --> 01:35:59.921
Where's my car?

1417
01:35:59.963 --> 01:36:03.591
Son, I need you to listen to me
very carefully.

1418
01:36:04.050 --> 01:36:05.760
People can die here.

1419
01:36:06.094 --> 01:36:08.846
We need to know everything you know.
We need to know it now.

1420
01:36:08.930 --> 01:36:10.139
Okay.

1421
01:36:10.223 --> 01:36:13.977
But first, I'll take my car, my parents.
Maybe you should write that down.

1422
01:36:14.060 --> 01:36:18.773
Oh, and her juvie record.
That's got to be gone. Like, forever.

1423
01:36:20.400 --> 01:36:23.403
Come with me.
We'll talk about your car.

1424
01:36:23.444 --> 01:36:24.779
Thank you.

1425
01:36:25.989 --> 01:36:27.782
The man's an extortionist.

1426
01:36:29.701 --> 01:36:31.077
All right, here's the situation.

1427
01:36:31.119 --> 01:36:33.579
You've all had direct contact
with the NBEs.

1428
01:36:33.621 --> 01:36:34.789
NBEs?

1429
01:36:34.831 --> 01:36:38.459
Non-Biological Extraterrestrials.
Try and keep up with the acronyms.

1430
01:36:38.543 --> 01:36:42.213
What you're about to see
is totally classified.

1431
01:36:51.347 --> 01:36:53.224
Dear God. What is this?

1432
01:36:54.767 --> 01:36:58.062
We think when he made his approach
over the north pole,

1433
01:36:58.146 --> 01:37:01.607
our gravitational field screwed up
his telemetry.

1434
01:37:01.649 --> 01:37:05.695
He crashed in the ice,
probably a few thousand years ago.

1435
01:37:05.778 --> 01:37:09.073
We shipped him here to this facility
in 1934.

1436
01:37:09.157 --> 01:37:11.576
We call him NBE One.

1437
01:37:11.659 --> 01:37:14.037
Well, sir, I don't mean to correct you
on everything you think you know,

1438
01:37:14.120 --> 01:37:16.539
but, I mean, that's Megatron.

1439
01:37:17.790 --> 01:37:19.667
He's the leader of the Decepticons.

1440
01:37:19.709 --> 01:37:23.087
He's been in cryostasis since 1935.

1441
01:37:23.171 --> 01:37:26.674
Your great-great-grandfather made
one of the greatest discoveries

1442
01:37:26.716 --> 01:37:28.176
in the history of mankind.

1443
01:37:28.259 --> 01:37:31.220
Fact is, you're looking at
the source of the modern age,

1444
01:37:31.304 --> 01:37:38.186
the microchip, lasers, spaceflight, cars,
all reverse-engineered by studying him.

1445
01:37:38.227 --> 01:37:42.065
NBE One. That's what we call it.

1446
01:37:42.607 --> 01:37:45.276
And you didn't think the United States
military might need to know

1447
01:37:45.360 --> 01:37:47.737
that you're keeping a hostile alien robot
frozen in the basement?

1448
01:37:47.820 --> 01:37:51.866
Until these events, we had no
credible threat to national security.

1449
01:37:51.908 --> 01:37:53.826
Well, you got one now.

1450
01:37:54.702 --> 01:37:57.163
-So why Earth?
-It's the All Spark.

1451
01:37:57.205 --> 01:37:58.790
All Spark? What is that?

1452
01:37:58.873 --> 01:38:01.459
Well, yeah, they came here looking
for some sort of cube-looking thing.

1453
01:38:01.542 --> 01:38:06.339
Anyway, Mr NBE One here, AKA
Megatron, that's what they call him,

1454
01:38:06.381 --> 01:38:08.883
who's pretty much the harbinger
of death, wants to use the Cube

1455
01:38:08.925 --> 01:38:12.053
to transform human technology
to take over the universe.

1456
01:38:12.136 --> 01:38:13.721
That's their plan.

1457
01:38:13.763 --> 01:38:16.224
-And you're sure about that?
-Yeah.

1458
01:38:18.518 --> 01:38:20.812
You guys know where it is, don't you?

1459
01:38:22.230 --> 01:38:23.398
Follow me.

1460
01:38:26.984 --> 01:38:29.529
You're about to see our crown jewel.

1461
01:38:38.413 --> 01:38:42.041
Carbon dating puts the Cube here
around 10,000 BC.

1462
01:38:42.917 --> 01:38:46.546
The first Seven didn't find it until 1913.

1463
01:38:47.380 --> 01:38:51.259
They knew it was alien because of
the matching hieroglyphics on the Cube

1464
01:38:51.342 --> 01:38:52.927
as well as NBE One.

1465
01:38:52.969 --> 01:38:55.596
President Hoover had the dam built
around it.

1466
01:38:55.638 --> 01:38:58.057
Four football fields thick of concrete.

1467
01:38:58.099 --> 01:39:01.477
A perfect way to hide its energy
from being detected by anyone

1468
01:39:01.561 --> 01:39:05.189
or any alien species on the outside.

1469
01:39:43.978 --> 01:39:47.815
Wait, back up. You said
the dam hides the Cube's energy.

1470
01:39:48.399 --> 01:39:50.943
-What kind exactly?
-Good question.

1471
01:39:55.531 --> 01:39:58.451
Please step inside.
They have to lock us in.

1472
01:40:04.332 --> 01:40:06.000
Oh, wow.

1473
01:40:06.083 --> 01:40:08.169
What's that? Freddy Krueger done
been up in here or something?

1474
01:40:08.211 --> 01:40:09.462
Oh, no, man.

1475
01:40:09.545 --> 01:40:14.050
Freddy Krueger have four blades, man.
That's only three. That's Wolverine!

1476
01:40:14.133 --> 01:40:17.094
-Right? That's Wolverine!
-That's very funny.

1477
01:40:18.596 --> 01:40:21.682
Anybody have any mechanical devices?
BlackBerry? Key alarm? Cell phone?

1478
01:40:21.724 --> 01:40:23.184
I got a phone.

1479
01:40:26.354 --> 01:40:29.023
Nokias are real nasty.

1480
01:40:29.065 --> 01:40:33.528
You've got to respect the Japanese.
They know the way of the samurai.

1481
01:40:34.320 --> 01:40:36.489
Nokia's from Finland.

1482
01:40:36.531 --> 01:40:41.160
Yes, but he's, you know, a little strange.
He's a little strange.

1483
01:40:43.871 --> 01:40:49.502
We're able to take the Cube radiation
and funnel it into that box.

1484
01:41:03.140 --> 01:41:06.477
-Mean little sucker, huh?
-That thing is freaky!

1485
01:41:06.561 --> 01:41:10.231
Kind of like the itty-bitty
Energizer Bunny from hell, huh?

1486
01:41:21.242 --> 01:41:23.119
He's breaking the box.

1487
01:41:41.095 --> 01:41:42.263
Go! Go! Go!

1488
01:41:42.305 --> 01:41:43.431
Move!

1489
01:41:51.939 --> 01:41:54.609
Gentlemen, they know the Cube is here.

1490
01:41:55.359 --> 01:41:56.736
Banachek. What's going on?

1491
01:41:56.777 --> 01:41:58.654
Well, the NBE One hangar
has lost power...

1492
01:41:58.738 --> 01:41:59.822
-What?
-...and the backup generator

1493
01:41:59.905 --> 01:42:01.907
-Is just not gonna cut it.
-Do you have an arms room?

1494
01:42:08.289 --> 01:42:10.082
Megatron! Megatron! Megatron!

1495
01:42:10.124 --> 01:42:11.584
I'll bring security to the...

1496
01:42:11.626 --> 01:42:14.211
Get everyone to
the NBE One chamber now!

1497
01:42:14.295 --> 01:42:15.921
-The lights are out!
-Move it! Move it!

1498
01:42:15.963 --> 01:42:17.381
Let's go!

1499
01:42:17.465 --> 01:42:19.258
They're popping our generators!

1500
01:42:31.228 --> 01:42:32.647
Megatron melting!

1501
01:42:33.230 --> 01:42:36.317
16502. We're losing pressure.

1502
01:42:36.400 --> 01:42:38.653
Stand by! Set!

1503
01:42:38.694 --> 01:42:40.821
We're losing pressure!

1504
01:42:40.863 --> 01:42:44.325
The cryogenic system is failing!
We're losing NBE One!

1505
01:42:49.038 --> 01:42:51.791
Forty millimetre sabot rounds
on that table!

1506
01:42:51.832 --> 01:42:55.878
That's good. Get all the ammo you got.
Everything you can carry. Bring it.

1507
01:43:01.384 --> 01:43:04.053
You got to take me to my car.
You have to take me to my car.

1508
01:43:04.136 --> 01:43:05.179
He's gonna know what to do
with the Cube.

1509
01:43:05.262 --> 01:43:07.223
-Your car? It's confiscated.
-Then unconfiscate it.

1510
01:43:07.306 --> 01:43:09.058
We do not know what will happen
if we let it near this thing!

1511
01:43:09.141 --> 01:43:10.434
-You don't know.
-Maybe you know, but I don't know.

1512
01:43:10.518 --> 01:43:11.894
You just wanna sit here and wait
and see what happens?

1513
01:43:11.977 --> 01:43:14.021
I have people's lives at stake here,
young man.

1514
01:43:14.063 --> 01:43:15.856
Take him to his car!

1515
01:43:17.525 --> 01:43:18.776
Drop it.

1516
01:43:20.528 --> 01:43:22.196
Whoa! Whoa! Whoa!

1517
01:43:23.447 --> 01:43:25.491
Drop your weapon, soldier.

1518
01:43:25.950 --> 01:43:27.702
There's an alien war going on
and you're gonna shoot me?

1519
01:43:27.785 --> 01:43:28.869
You know, we didn't ask to be here.

1520
01:43:28.911 --> 01:43:31.163
I'm ordering you under S-Seven
executive jurisdiction.

1521
01:43:31.205 --> 01:43:32.415
S-Seven don't exist.

1522
01:43:32.498 --> 01:43:34.291
Right. And we don't take orders
from people that don't exist.

1523
01:43:34.375 --> 01:43:37.670
-I'm gonna count to five. Okay.
-Well, I'm gonna count to three.

1524
01:43:40.214 --> 01:43:41.882
-Simmons?
-Yes, sir?

1525
01:43:41.966 --> 01:43:46.053
I'd do what he says. Losing's really
not an option for these guys.

1526
01:43:50.558 --> 01:43:52.560
All right. Okay.

1527
01:43:52.601 --> 01:43:57.148
Hey, you want to lay the fate of the
world on the kid's Camaro? That's cool.

1528
01:44:00.693 --> 01:44:01.986
No, no!

1529
01:44:02.903 --> 01:44:05.614
Stop! You got to stop! Stop! Stop! Stop!

1530
01:44:05.698 --> 01:44:09.285
No, no, stop, stop, stop!
Let him go! Let him go!

1531
01:44:10.453 --> 01:44:11.912
Are you okay?

1532
01:44:13.748 --> 01:44:15.875
They didn't hurt you, right?

1533
01:44:24.592 --> 01:44:28.429
Listen to me. The Cube is here
and the Decepticons are coming.

1534
01:44:30.765 --> 01:44:32.933
No, no, don't worry about them.
They're okay. Right?

1535
01:44:32.975 --> 01:44:35.269
They're not gonna hurt you.

1536
01:44:35.311 --> 01:44:38.898
Just back up a little bit.
He's friendly. He's fine.

1537
01:44:38.939 --> 01:44:42.276
Okay, come on. Put the guns down.
They're not gonna hurt you.

1538
01:44:42.318 --> 01:44:43.861
Here, come with me.
I'm gonna take you to the All Spark.

1539
01:45:05.883 --> 01:45:09.428
Okay, here we go. He doing something.
He doing something.

1540
01:45:29.490 --> 01:45:30.866
Oh, my God.

1541
01:45:35.663 --> 01:45:37.081
Message from Starfleet, Captain.

1542
01:45:37.164 --> 01:45:38.582
Let's get to it.

1543
01:45:38.666 --> 01:45:41.710
He's right. We stay here, we're screwed
with Megatron in the other hangar.

1544
01:45:41.794 --> 01:45:43.212
Mission City is 22 miles away.

1545
01:45:43.295 --> 01:45:44.630
We're gonna sneak that Cube
out of here

1546
01:45:44.672 --> 01:45:46.131
and we're gonna hide it somewhere
in the city.

1547
01:45:46.173 --> 01:45:47.174
Good! Right.

1548
01:45:47.258 --> 01:45:50.010
But we cannot make a stand
without the Air Force.

1549
01:45:50.094 --> 01:45:52.179
This place must have some kind
of radio link!

1550
01:45:52.263 --> 01:45:54.181
-Yes. Shortwave, CB.
-Right, yes.

1551
01:45:54.223 --> 01:45:56.851
Sir, you got to figure out some way
to get word out to them. Let's move!

1552
01:45:56.934 --> 01:45:58.394
In the alien archive, sir!

1553
01:45:58.477 --> 01:46:00.521
-The alien...
-There's an old Army radio console.

1554
01:46:00.563 --> 01:46:02.147
-Will it work?
-Anything's possible!

1555
01:46:02.189 --> 01:46:04.692
-Did you see that...
-All right, Sam, get it in the car!

1556
01:46:04.733 --> 01:46:06.527
Mr Secretary! Get our birds in the air.

1557
01:46:06.610 --> 01:46:08.279
When we get to the city,
we're gonna find a radio,

1558
01:46:08.362 --> 01:46:10.364
and I'll have Epps vector them in, okay?

1559
01:46:10.406 --> 01:46:11.991
Affirmative!

1560
01:46:12.032 --> 01:46:15.911
Warning! NBE One
cryo-containment failing.

1561
01:46:16.871 --> 01:46:18.789
Check that backup system!

1562
01:46:18.873 --> 01:46:23.043
The cryo's failing! You got to bump up
the cryo! The cryo's failing!

1563
01:46:23.127 --> 01:46:24.670
Come on! Get out of here!

1564
01:46:24.712 --> 01:46:26.297
Heads up! Look out!

1565
01:46:27.256 --> 01:46:29.717
Set a perimeter around
the yellow vehicle!

1566
01:46:29.758 --> 01:46:33.220
-This way, this way, this way!
-Up there! Let's go!

1567
01:46:42.897 --> 01:46:46.025
I am Megatron!

1568
01:47:04.793 --> 01:47:06.253
-The Cube's okay?
-Yeah, it's fine.

1569
01:47:06.295 --> 01:47:07.338
Well, put the seat belt on.

1570
01:47:07.421 --> 01:47:08.589
Pour it on him!

1571
01:47:22.311 --> 01:47:24.355
I live to serve you, Lord Megatron.

1572
01:47:24.438 --> 01:47:26.857
Where is the Cube?

1573
01:47:26.941 --> 01:47:29.026
The humans have taken it.

1574
01:47:32.363 --> 01:47:36.283
You fail me yet again, Starscream.
Get them!

1575
01:47:36.659 --> 01:47:38.160
Come on, Mags!

1576
01:47:39.244 --> 01:47:40.788
Over here, sir!

1577
01:47:43.082 --> 01:47:45.167
Give me a minute. Give me a minute.

1578
01:47:45.250 --> 01:47:47.711
Come to me, Maxwell, come to me.
Plugged in there.

1579
01:47:49.588 --> 01:47:53.092
-We're hot! We're live!
-Where are the mikes?

1580
01:47:54.093 --> 01:47:55.135
Mikes?

1581
01:47:55.177 --> 01:47:56.470
This doesn't work without mikes,
Simmons.

1582
01:47:56.553 --> 01:47:58.138
No, no, no, no, no, no, no!

1583
01:47:58.222 --> 01:47:59.807
Let's find them.

1584
01:47:59.848 --> 01:48:01.350
Kid, get in the chair!
Just get in the chair, all right?

1585
01:48:01.433 --> 01:48:03.644
-Okay, I'll sit. I'll sit.
-They steal everything out of this place.

1586
01:48:03.686 --> 01:48:06.814
How do we get the signal out?
How do we call the Air Force?

1587
01:48:06.855 --> 01:48:08.190
-Glen?
-Huh?

1588
01:48:08.273 --> 01:48:11.819
Can you hot wire this computer to
transmit a tone through the radio?

1589
01:48:11.860 --> 01:48:12.903
What good is that?

1590
01:48:12.987 --> 01:48:15.406
Morse code! You can use this
to transmit it through that!

1591
01:48:15.489 --> 01:48:19.076
Okay, I'll do it! Turn it around.
Okay, let's see.

1592
01:48:19.159 --> 01:48:20.995
Simmons, I need a screwdriver!

1593
01:48:32.756 --> 01:48:34.341
There's Optimus.

1594
01:48:52.234 --> 01:48:53.736
Almost done.

1595
01:48:55.529 --> 01:48:57.489
What the hell was that?

1596
01:49:00.534 --> 01:49:02.244
Barricade the door!

1597
01:49:04.955 --> 01:49:07.374
-Get something.
-Watch out!

1598
01:49:07.416 --> 01:49:09.543
Six, five, four, six, three.

1599
01:49:14.214 --> 01:49:16.592
Here! Put some rounds in!

1600
01:49:19.428 --> 01:49:20.888
Master search.

1601
01:49:21.764 --> 01:49:23.807
I got it We're transmitting!

1602
01:49:23.891 --> 01:49:25.059
Send exactly what I say!

1603
01:49:25.100 --> 01:49:29.271
Get out of the way! Get out of the way!
Burn, you little sucker! Burn!

1604
01:49:29.354 --> 01:49:33.400
"This is Defence Secretary Keller.
Get me NORTHCOM commander."

1605
01:49:33.484 --> 01:49:35.069
-Whoa!
-Whoa!

1606
01:49:36.737 --> 01:49:37.780
What was that?

1607
01:49:37.863 --> 01:49:40.741
Authenticate emergency action.
Blackbird 1195...

1608
01:49:42.868 --> 01:49:44.912
Sir, I have an authenticated
air strike order from Sec Def.

1609
01:50:09.770 --> 01:50:11.772
-No, no, no, no, no.
-What?

1610
01:50:11.855 --> 01:50:15.317
It's the same cop!
Block them, block them, block them.

1611
01:50:36.505 --> 01:50:37.548
Oh, my God.

1612
01:51:06.076 --> 01:51:07.452
Cool, Mom!

1613
01:51:33.312 --> 01:51:35.355
This is so not good.

1614
01:51:53.790 --> 01:51:55.709
He's behind the pillar!

1615
01:52:01.548 --> 01:52:04.676
-Shoot that mother...
-Maggie, cover fire!

1616
01:52:07.763 --> 01:52:10.140
It's the Air Force! They're responding!

1617
01:52:13.977 --> 01:52:15.979
Sucker, burn!

1618
01:52:21.735 --> 01:52:23.070
Oh, shit!

1619
01:52:23.403 --> 01:52:25.447
Yes! They're sending F-22s to the city!

1620
01:52:26.615 --> 01:52:28.700
Raptors, let's scramble,
scramble, scramble.

1621
01:52:29.868 --> 01:52:32.162
Strike and Dark Star roll call.

1622
01:52:34.456 --> 01:52:35.958
Looking out the right side.

1623
01:52:36.833 --> 01:52:39.044
Push to Kill Box One Alpha...

1624
01:52:46.593 --> 01:52:50.180
-Come on, let's go! Mount up!
-Move out! Move out! Go! Go!

1625
01:52:50.264 --> 01:52:52.474
Here, I got shortwave radios.

1626
01:52:52.975 --> 01:52:55.227
Wait. What am I supposed to
do with these?

1627
01:52:55.269 --> 01:52:57.604
Well, use them! It's all we got!

1628
01:52:57.980 --> 01:53:01.024
This is like RadioShack dinosaur radios
or something, man.

1629
01:53:01.108 --> 01:53:04.069
I'm only gonna get 20 or 30 miles
out of these things.

1630
01:53:04.111 --> 01:53:06.863
Are there any aircraft orbiting the city?

1631
01:53:07.447 --> 01:53:09.074
F-22 at 12200.

1632
01:53:09.116 --> 01:53:11.868
All right, I want planes for air cover
and get Black Hawks on station

1633
01:53:11.952 --> 01:53:13.829
to extract that Cube. You got it?

1634
01:53:16.290 --> 01:53:18.750
Air Force has arrived! Pop smoke!

1635
01:53:19.001 --> 01:53:20.669
Raptor, Raptor, do you copy?

1636
01:53:21.920 --> 01:53:23.130
We have you visual.

1637
01:53:24.756 --> 01:53:26.133
Green smoke is the mark.

1638
01:53:26.174 --> 01:53:29.678
Provide air cover and vector
Black Hawks for extraction.

1639
01:53:34.308 --> 01:53:36.310
It's Starscream!

1640
01:53:36.727 --> 01:53:38.437
Please tell me you copy.

1641
01:53:38.729 --> 01:53:41.064
Back up! Take cover! Bumblebee!

1642
01:53:44.818 --> 01:53:46.820
No, no, no, no, no! Move!

1643
01:53:46.903 --> 01:53:50.115
-Back up! Back up!
-Retreat! Fall back!

1644
01:53:50.157 --> 01:53:51.450
Incoming!

1645
01:54:16.516 --> 01:54:18.352
Anybody hurt? Everyone okay?

1646
01:54:18.393 --> 01:54:19.895
Clear the area!

1647
01:54:25.692 --> 01:54:27.235
Oh, my God.

1648
01:54:28.070 --> 01:54:30.989
Bumblebee? No. Your legs!

1649
01:54:31.365 --> 01:54:32.741
Your legs.

1650
01:54:34.284 --> 01:54:37.954
Here. Here, back, back, back, back!
You all right?

1651
01:54:39.456 --> 01:54:41.917
Please get up. Bumblebee? Get up!

1652
01:54:43.460 --> 01:54:44.711
Ratchet!

1653
01:54:46.546 --> 01:54:48.048
-What the hell was that?
-What are you talking about?

1654
01:54:48.090 --> 01:54:50.050
What do you mean, what am
I talking about? They shot at us!

1655
01:54:50.133 --> 01:54:52.552
F-22 pilots would never fly
below buildings.

1656
01:54:52.594 --> 01:54:54.805
That's alien. That ain't friendly!

1657
01:54:54.888 --> 01:54:57.724
You got to get up. You're okay.
You're okay.

1658
01:54:58.934 --> 01:55:00.018
Come on!

1659
01:55:00.060 --> 01:55:02.229
Army Black Hawk inbound
to your location. Over.

1660
01:55:03.980 --> 01:55:06.149
Alpha 273 degrees, 10 miles.

1661
01:55:06.233 --> 01:55:08.568
November Victor, 1.2 clicks north.

1662
01:55:26.753 --> 01:55:28.255
Move out! Let's go!

1663
01:55:34.636 --> 01:55:36.388
Let's go! Move!

1664
01:55:42.936 --> 01:55:44.646
I'm not gonna leave you.

1665
01:56:23.727 --> 01:56:25.812
Come on, Decepticon punk!

1666
01:56:32.068 --> 01:56:33.653
Oh, my God!

1667
01:56:46.166 --> 01:56:48.126
Concentrate your fire!

1668
01:56:59.012 --> 01:57:00.222
Come on. Come on.

1669
01:57:02.766 --> 01:57:04.518
Megatron!

1670
01:57:09.189 --> 01:57:12.859
It's Megatron! Retreat! Move! Fall back!

1671
01:57:17.113 --> 01:57:18.740
Fall back!

1672
01:57:24.704 --> 01:57:26.957
Get our guys out of the way!
Get out of here! Go!

1673
01:57:27.040 --> 01:57:29.084
Get them out of the buggy! Move out!

1674
01:57:29.167 --> 01:57:31.461
We need air cover down here now!

1675
01:57:37.425 --> 01:57:38.885
Sam, help me with this.

1676
01:57:43.014 --> 01:57:47.394
-That all you got, Megatron?
-Come here, little cretin.

1677
01:57:47.435 --> 01:57:49.563
You want a piece of me?
You want a piece?

1678
01:57:49.646 --> 01:57:51.982
No! I want two!

1679
01:57:53.525 --> 01:57:54.943
What's going on?

1680
01:57:56.736 --> 01:57:59.406
Sir! That tank thing's getting back up.

1681
01:58:00.240 --> 01:58:02.534
Oh, these things just don't die.

1682
01:58:06.079 --> 01:58:07.581
Oh, we're so dead.

1683
01:58:07.664 --> 01:58:10.041
-Wrap it around the head.
-Sam!

1684
01:58:10.292 --> 01:58:11.334
Where's the Cube?

1685
01:58:11.418 --> 01:58:12.419
-Right there.
-Okay.

1686
01:58:12.460 --> 01:58:13.503
And take that and wrap it around

1687
01:58:13.587 --> 01:58:14.588
the base and then put it
around his neck.

1688
01:58:14.629 --> 01:58:17.340
-Okay?
-Epps, get those Black Hawks here!

1689
01:58:18.758 --> 01:58:20.260
That building.

1690
01:58:23.972 --> 01:58:25.807
-Okay.
-What?

1691
01:58:25.890 --> 01:58:28.893
All right, I can't leave my guys back
there, so here, take this flare.

1692
01:58:28.935 --> 01:58:31.271
Okay, there's a tall, white building
with statues on top.

1693
01:58:31.313 --> 01:58:33.565
-Go to the roof. Set the flare.
-No.

1694
01:58:33.607 --> 01:58:35.609
-Signal the chopper and set the flare.
-No, no. I can't do this!

1695
01:58:35.650 --> 01:58:40.113
Listen to me! You're a soldier now!
All right? I need you to take this Cube.

1696
01:58:40.155 --> 01:58:42.449
Get it into military hands
while we hold them off,

1697
01:58:42.490 --> 01:58:44.618
or a lot of people are gonna die.

1698
01:58:44.701 --> 01:58:46.244
-You got to go. You got to go.
-No, I'm not leaving.

1699
01:58:46.286 --> 01:58:47.495
-You need to go. Go.
-No, I'm not leaving

1700
01:58:47.579 --> 01:58:50.290
till I get Bumblebee out of here, okay?

1701
01:58:51.750 --> 01:58:52.834
Army Black Hawk requested.

1702
01:58:52.917 --> 01:58:55.462
Immediate evac for civilian boy
with precious cargo.

1703
01:58:55.545 --> 01:58:58.131
Headed to rooftop marked by flare.

1704
01:58:58.173 --> 01:59:01.301
-Sam, we will protect you.
-Okay.

1705
01:59:02.886 --> 01:59:06.264
-Epps, where are those planes?
-Sam!

1706
01:59:10.185 --> 01:59:14.356
No matter what happens,
I'm really glad I got in that car with you.

1707
01:59:17.567 --> 01:59:20.236
Sam! Get to the building! Move!

1708
01:59:20.320 --> 01:59:23.573
-Decepticons, attack!
-Hit it!

1709
01:59:26.284 --> 01:59:28.411
-Cover fire!
-Move to cover!

1710
01:59:34.834 --> 01:59:36.169
Watch out!

1711
01:59:41.716 --> 01:59:44.803
-Girl, get that tow truck out of here!
-I'm going! I'm going!

1712
01:59:44.844 --> 01:59:46.554
Get out of here now!

1713
02:00:14.374 --> 02:00:15.375
Megatron!

1714
02:00:15.667 --> 02:00:16.668
Prime.

1715
02:00:42.569 --> 02:00:44.696
Humans don't deserve to live.

1716
02:00:44.738 --> 02:00:47.449
They deserve to choose for themselves.

1717
02:00:47.866 --> 02:00:50.243
Then you will die with them!

1718
02:00:55.915 --> 02:00:58.334
Join them in extinction!

1719
02:01:17.520 --> 02:01:19.230
Keep moving, Sam!

1720
02:01:20.190 --> 02:01:21.608
Don't stop!

1721
02:01:37.582 --> 02:01:38.625
No!

1722
02:01:53.807 --> 02:01:55.934
Sam, get to the building!

1723
02:02:03.817 --> 02:02:05.985
Give me that Cube, boy!

1724
02:02:18.581 --> 02:02:20.708
Did that jerk just dent my car?

1725
02:02:42.021 --> 02:02:45.525
You're not gonna get me.
You're not gonna get me!

1726
02:02:50.822 --> 02:02:53.992
I smell you, boy!

1727
02:03:06.170 --> 02:03:07.380
Maggot!

1728
02:03:26.357 --> 02:03:27.984
Oh, no!

1729
02:03:52.508 --> 02:03:54.385
I'll drive! You shoot!

1730
02:04:15.281 --> 02:04:16.616
This isn't going well!

1731
02:04:16.699 --> 02:04:18.117
Shoot! Shoot!

1732
02:05:03.955 --> 02:05:05.206
Nice shot.

1733
02:05:05.289 --> 02:05:08.793
-That tank is definitely dead now.
-All right, let's go! We got business!

1734
02:05:19.220 --> 02:05:20.346
Hey!

1735
02:05:23.766 --> 02:05:27.228
Hey! I'm over here!

1736
02:05:39.532 --> 02:05:41.284
We've got the boy.

1737
02:05:45.872 --> 02:05:47.331
Watch out!

1738
02:05:47.665 --> 02:05:48.875
Missile!

1739
02:05:59.343 --> 02:06:00.803
Hang on, Sam!

1740
02:06:09.520 --> 02:06:10.897
No! No!

1741
02:06:16.569 --> 02:06:21.616
Is it fear or courage
that compels you, fleshling?

1742
02:06:35.129 --> 02:06:36.631
Where do I go?

1743
02:06:37.924 --> 02:06:41.928
Give me the All Spark
and you may live to be my pet.

1744
02:06:43.221 --> 02:06:44.889
Oh, no, no, no, no.

1745
02:06:49.018 --> 02:06:51.479
I'm never giving you this All Spark!

1746
02:06:51.604 --> 02:06:54.440
Oh, so unwise.

1747
02:07:06.327 --> 02:07:07.870
I got you, boy.

1748
02:07:09.622 --> 02:07:11.457
Hold on to the Cube!

1749
02:07:31.144 --> 02:07:34.021
-Oh, no. Oh, no!
-Disgusting.

1750
02:07:38.985 --> 02:07:40.069
Sam?

1751
02:07:44.323 --> 02:07:47.577
You risked your life to protect the Cube.

1752
02:07:48.286 --> 02:07:49.787
No sacrifice,

1753
02:07:51.122 --> 02:07:54.208
-no victory.
-If I cannot defeat Megatron,

1754
02:07:54.500 --> 02:07:57.044
you must push the Cube into my chest.

1755
02:07:57.420 --> 02:08:00.673
I will sacrifice myself to destroy it.

1756
02:08:01.090 --> 02:08:02.592
Get behind me.

1757
02:08:04.260 --> 02:08:06.846
It's you and me, Megatron.

1758
02:08:06.929 --> 02:08:09.891
No, it's just me, Prime.

1759
02:08:12.310 --> 02:08:17.481
At the end of this day,
one shall stand, one shall fall.

1760
02:08:22.862 --> 02:08:27.700
You still fight for the weak!
That is why you lose!

1761
02:08:46.844 --> 02:08:49.263
Fighter jets in 60 seconds.

1762
02:08:49.347 --> 02:08:51.849
We got friendlies mixed with bad guys.
Targets will be marked.

1763
02:08:51.891 --> 02:08:52.975
Hey.

1764
02:08:54.143 --> 02:08:56.354
Bring the rain. All right?

1765
02:08:56.729 --> 02:08:58.731
All right, let's kill these things.

1766
02:09:00.691 --> 02:09:02.276
-Move, move, move!
-Remember, aim low.

1767
02:09:02.360 --> 02:09:04.403
Armour's weak under the chest.

1768
02:09:14.413 --> 02:09:16.040
Target marked. Still waiting.

1769
02:09:16.082 --> 02:09:18.167
Time on target, 20 seconds.

1770
02:09:25.091 --> 02:09:27.218
F-22s, we're still waiting.

1771
02:09:32.431 --> 02:09:33.891
Move out!

1772
02:09:37.103 --> 02:09:38.354
Incoming!

1773
02:09:46.862 --> 02:09:48.990
Weapons armed. Status green.

1774
02:10:07.633 --> 02:10:09.468
Run! Move!

1775
02:10:16.976 --> 02:10:18.519
Second wave's on approach.

1776
02:10:21.981 --> 02:10:23.649
What is that? Break off!

1777
02:10:23.691 --> 02:10:26.193
-Copy.
-It's either a massive amount of...

1778
02:10:34.910 --> 02:10:37.121
Two, get a lock! Pop that guy!

1779
02:10:41.167 --> 02:10:43.127
Stay on him. Keep him in your sights.

1780
02:10:43.627 --> 02:10:44.962
Take him out!

1781
02:10:59.143 --> 02:11:00.519
Two's down!

1782
02:11:09.904 --> 02:11:11.864
I'll kill you!

1783
02:11:11.947 --> 02:11:14.700
Mine! All Spark!

1784
02:11:15.659 --> 02:11:18.537
Sam! Put the Cube in my chest! Now!

1785
02:11:19.205 --> 02:11:20.289
Sam!

1786
02:11:21.123 --> 02:11:22.375
No, Sam!

1787
02:11:48.109 --> 02:11:49.360
Hold up.

1788
02:11:52.405 --> 02:11:55.408
You left me no choice, brother.

1789
02:12:05.000 --> 02:12:07.920
Sam, I owe you my life.

1790
02:12:09.004 --> 02:12:10.756
We are in your debt.

1791
02:12:30.276 --> 02:12:32.695
Prime, we couldn't save him.

1792
02:12:33.529 --> 02:12:34.864
Jazz.

1793
02:12:38.033 --> 02:12:40.286
We lost a great comrade

1794
02:12:41.579 --> 02:12:43.456
but gained new ones.

1795
02:12:43.706 --> 02:12:46.041
Thank you, all of you.

1796
02:12:46.333 --> 02:12:48.752
You honour us with your bravery.

1797
02:12:49.753 --> 02:12:51.755
Permission to speak, sir?

1798
02:12:52.214 --> 02:12:55.134
Permission granted, old friend.

1799
02:12:55.176 --> 02:12:56.677
You speak now?

1800
02:12:57.595 --> 02:12:59.722
I wish to stay with the boy.

1801
02:13:00.556 --> 02:13:02.433
If that is his choice.

1802
02:13:07.313 --> 02:13:08.397
Yes.

1803
02:13:29.001 --> 02:13:33.797
Gentlemen, the President has ordered
Sector Seven be terminated

1804
02:13:34.298 --> 02:13:37.343
and the remains of the dead aliens
disposed of.

1805
02:13:37.968 --> 02:13:41.305
The Laurentian Abyss is
seven miles below sea level,

1806
02:13:41.347 --> 02:13:43.516
deepest place on our planet.

1807
02:13:43.682 --> 02:13:47.269
The massive depth and pressure there,
coupled with subfreezing temperatures,

1808
02:13:47.353 --> 02:13:49.563
would crush and entomb them,

1809
02:13:51.357 --> 02:13:53.108
leaving no evidence.

1810
02:13:59.698 --> 02:14:04.161
With the All Spark gone,
we cannot return life to our planet.

1811
02:14:05.871 --> 02:14:08.499
And fate has yielded its reward,

1812
02:14:10.000 --> 02:14:12.920
a new world to call home.

1813
02:14:19.176 --> 02:14:23.389
We live among its people now,
hiding in plain sight,

1814
02:14:23.514 --> 02:14:26.308
but watching over them in secret,

1815
02:14:26.517 --> 02:14:29.103
waiting, protecting.

1816
02:14:30.479 --> 02:14:33.566
I have witnessed
their capacity for courage.

1817
02:14:34.108 --> 02:14:37.152
And though we are worlds apart,

1818
02:14:37.236 --> 02:14:42.199
like us, there's more to them
than meets the eye.

1819
02:14:43.701 --> 02:14:46.245
I am Optimus Prime

1820
02:14:46.579 --> 02:14:49.999
and I send this message
to any surviving Autobots

1821
02:14:50.082 --> 02:14:53.085
taking refuge among the stars.

1822
02:14:54.086 --> 02:14:55.879
We are here.

1823
02:14:56.422 --> 02:14:58.465
<i>We are waiting.</i>

1824
02:15:17.776 --> 02:15:22.823
Can you shed any light on the recent,
so-called alien activity in the area?

1825
02:15:25.784 --> 02:15:31.332
Do you know what? I think that
if there was some sort of an alien

1826
02:15:31.915 --> 02:15:33.834
-infestation...
-Yeah.

1827
02:15:34.168 --> 02:15:36.629
They, the government,
would be the first to let you know.

1828
02:15:36.712 --> 02:15:38.422
The government would let us know.

1829
02:15:38.547 --> 02:15:40.174
-I mean, this is America.
-Yeah.

1830
02:15:40.257 --> 02:15:42.718
You know, that's how we know
we live in a free land,

1831
02:15:42.801 --> 02:15:44.470
because there's no secrets.

1832
02:15:44.511 --> 02:15:46.639
They'd say, "Hey! Duck and cover."

1833
02:15:56.649 --> 02:15:59.985
Your head is kind of a different size
than it is on television.

